  <div class="hero-content" style="text-align: center; display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: center;">
    <div class="hero-label">Photographer &amp; Storyteller</div>
    <h1>Rafa Lanús</h1>
    <p class="hero-sub" style="text-align: center;">Editorial + Documentary<br class="mobile-br"> — from red carpets to remote places</p>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- INTRO -->
<section class="side-section">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="side-inner fade-up">
      <div class="side-text">
        <h2>A photographer,<br class="mobile-br"> built for contrast</h2>
        <p><a href="http://www.rafalanus.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener" style="color: var(--color-warm-dark); text-decoration: underline;">Rafa Lanús</a> is a photographer and storyteller who moves easily between worlds. High-profile editorial work, remote documentary assignments, and everything in between. Grounded approach, calm logistics, and an eye for the small moment that makes a story feel real, whether the location is a red carpet or a village reached after hours in a 4×4.</p>
        <a href="/contact/" class="btn btn-dark">Hire Rafa</a>
      </div>
      <div class="side-image" style="aspect-ratio: 2/3;">
        {% image "/images/uploads/rafa-lanus-photographer-oscars.jpg", "Rafa Lanús at the Oscars", "lazy", "(max-width: 768px) 100vw, 40vw", "", "aspect-ratio: 2/3; object-position: center top;" %}
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- SUNDAY TO MONDAY STORY -->
<section style="padding: clamp(3rem, 6vw, 5rem) 0; border-top: 1px solid var(--color-faint);">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-label">A true story</div>
    <h2 class="section-heading" style="max-width: 640px;">Sunday to Monday: two worlds</h2>
    <p style="color: var(--color-muted); font-size: 1.05rem; line-height: 1.8; max-width: 640px; margin-bottom: clamp(2rem, 4vw, 3.5rem);">This is a tiny true story that describes how my life is. One day under the brightest lights. The next, deep in rural Guatemala with family in tow. Different settings, same mission: earn trust fast, move smart, and deliver images that make people feel something.</p>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- STORY STEPS -->
<section class="story-steps">
  <div class="container">

    <div class="story-step fade-up">
      <div class="story-step-image">
        {% image "/images/uploads/lots-of-camera-gear-ready-for-assignment.jpg", "Prep mode, batteries charged, suits pressed" %}
      </div>
      <div class="story-step-text">
        <div class="story-step-num">01</div>
        <h3>The setup</h3>
        <p class="story-step-when">Saturday — Prep mode</p>
        <p>Batteries charged, cards cleared, suits pressed. The calm before the biggest lights.</p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="story-step fade-up">
      <div class="story-step-image">
        {% image "/images/uploads/rafa-lanus-at-the-oscars.jpg", "The Oscars, red carpets and portraits" %}
      </div>
      <div class="story-step-text">
        <div class="story-step-num">02</div>
        <h3>The spotlight</h3>
        <p class="story-step-when">Sunday — The Oscars</p>
        <p>A familiar rhythm: red carpets, portraits, and moments that disappear in seconds.</p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="story-step fade-up">
      <div class="story-step-image">
        {% image "/images/uploads/family-ready-for-helicopter-ride.jpg", "Tuxedos to backpacks, boarding a plane to Guatemala" %}
      </div>
      <div class="story-step-text">
        <div class="story-step-num">03</div>
        <h3>The switch</h3>
        <p class="story-step-when">Monday (early) — Tuxedos to backpacks</p>
        <p>The family boards a plane to Guatemala City. Same storyteller, new terrain.</p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="story-step fade-up">
      <div class="story-step-image">
        {% image "/images/uploads/filmmaker-in-a-helicopter.jpg", "Helicopter to Chimaltenango" %}
      </div>
      <div class="story-step-text">
        <div class="story-step-num">04</div>
        <h3>The lift</h3>
        <p class="story-step-when">Monday (afternoon) — Helicopter to Chimaltenango</p>
        <p>We lift off toward the NGO headquarters where the road doesn't really start until it ends.</p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="story-step fade-up">
      <div class="story-step-image">
        {% image "/images/uploads/the-defender-family-in-guatemala.jpg", "4x4 days through villages" %}
      </div>
      <div class="story-step-text">
        <div class="story-step-num">05</div>
        <h3>The miles</h3>
        <p class="story-step-when">Tuesday to Friday — Village by village</p>
        <p>Early mornings out, late afternoons back. Hours of rough tracks to reach communities far beyond the easy route.</p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="story-step fade-up">
      <div class="story-step-image">
        {% image "/images/uploads/guatemalan-girl-by-rafa-lanus.jpg", "Capturing impact in the field" %}
      </div>
      <div class="story-step-text">
        <div class="story-step-num">06</div>
        <h3>The mission</h3>
        <p class="story-step-when">Along the way — Capturing impact</p>
        <p>Not just images, presence. Footage donors can step inside, not just scroll past.</p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="story-step fade-up">
      <div class="story-step-image">
        {% image "/images/uploads/ngo-workers-in-guatemala.jpg", "Family time in Antigua" %}
      </div>
      <div class="story-step-text">
        <div class="story-step-num">07</div>
        <h3>The exhale</h3>
        <p class="story-step-when">Weekend — Antigua, together</p>
        <p>A slower pace, family time, and the quiet reminder: the best stories are still lived, not staged.</p>
      </div>
    </div>

  </div>
</section>

